        "content": {
          "content_type": "code",
          "language": "json",
          "response_format_name": null,
          "text": "{\"prompt\":\"Create a redesigned PPT slide image as a polished visual example based on Image A. Image A is a screenshot of the current slide. Keep the same overall dark green, teal, and cream color palette, the same broad three-column structure, and the same topic: '解决方案 四大核心技术解决院后康复关键痛点'. Preserve the brand label 'CardioPilot' at the top right. This should look like a refined presentation slide, not a poster.\\n\\nRedesign the slide to feel less text-heavy and more visually engaging while keeping the core content conceptually similar. Use a clean, professional, modern Chinese presentation style with strong readability.\\n\\nLayout requirements:\\n1. Top title bar: keep a strong title area with the Chinese title on the left and 'CardioPilot' on the right.\\n2. Three main columns with clear headings:\\n   - Left heading: '核心技术'\\n   - Middle heading: '实现功能'\\n   - Right heading: '共同带来的三方价值'\\n3. Left column: show 4 stacked technology cards. Each card should include a numbered circular badge, a small line-style icon, a concise bold technology title, and a short supporting phrase. Use these four items:\\n   01 多智能体冲突约束协同推理框架 — 多智能体协同·指南遵循\\n   02 “生成-监督-审核”三重监测框架 — 改善模型输出·保障问答安全\\n   03 基于信号模态分解与集成的时间序列表征学习框架 — 生理信号异常识别·风险预警\\n   04 基于元问答的医疗领域大语言模型知识增强技术 — MQ-RAG·降低幻觉风险\\n4. Middle column: show 4 vertically arranged functional nodes with icons and subtle glow, connected as a capability chain. Use these labels:\\n   科学干预方案生成\\n   安全可靠咨询\\n   主动智能预警\\n   长期依从性提升\\n5. Add elegant arrows or flow indicators from the left column to the middle column and from the middle to the right column.\\n6. Right column: a larger panel summarizing value. At the top, include a highlight sentence: '最终落到三方价值：更安心、更省心、更高效'. Then show 3 distinct horizontal value cards with simple avatar icons:\\n   患者 — 康复更安心 — 个性化路径 + 可靠解答 + 风险提醒\\n   家属 — 照护更省心 — 明确照护重点 + 权威信息 + 及时提醒\\n   医生 — 管理更高效 — 方案制定更快 + 咨询负担更低 + 风险掌握更及时\\n7. Bottom summary band: replace the long sentence with a visually strong summary strip. Include the text:\\n   四项技术共同补齐院后康复四大短板\\n   专业性   可信度   及时性   持续性\\n   Render these four keywords as separate highlighted tags or capsules.\\n\\nDesign guidance:\\n- Make the page cleaner, more spacious, and more premium than the original.\\n- Use iconography, subtle glow, light separators, and card hierarchy to break up the text.\\n- Keep text concise and readable, with balanced spacing and alignment.\\n- Ensure it still feels like a real PPT page, suitable for a project presentation or competition deck.\\n- Use polished Chinese typography and avoid clutter.\\n- Output a single full-slide example image.\", \"reference_image_paths\":[\"/mnt/data/ghostwriter_images/context/e83fb20c-317b-5f15-8bbb-f5026b3e5cb6.png\"], \"aspect_ratio\":\"16:9\"}"
