ting flow. **Center column** header in a rounded pill: “实现功能”. Beneath it a vertical stack of four rounded dark panels with glowing neon teal outlines and icons on the left inside circular icon areas, connected by a vertical line with small glowing nodes, forming a process chain. Top item: icon of a document/clipboard with a heart and lines; text “科学干预方案生成” in pale yellow/white. Second: speech bubble icon (chat bubble); text “安全可靠咨询”. Third: bell icon; text “主动智能预警”. Fourth: rising chart/arrow icon; text “长期依从性提升”. The panels are dark with teal glow and the icons are teal line art; the text is bold pale yellow/white. **Right column** header in a teal pill: “共同带来的三方价值”. Below it, a large rounded panel/box. At the top inside is a highlighted line in pale yellow: “最终落到三方价值： 更安心、更省心、更高效” with a dotted/line divider beneath. Inside are three horizontal value cards stacked vertically, each with a circular avatar icon at the left and text to the right, all on dark green panels with teal accents. First row (top): left avatar circle shows a simple illustrated person (looks like a young/middle‑aged East Asian/neutral skin tone cartoon male with short dark hair, smiling, wearing a teal/green shirt). To the right: big text “患者 — 康复更安心” (the dash/em dash style; “康复更安心” in teal). Beneath in smaller text: “个性化路径 + 可靠解答 + 风险提醒”. Second row: avatar of a woman (cartoon, medium skin tone, dark/black hair, simple style, wearing a warm/orange/peach top). Text: “家属 — 照护更省心” (with “照护更省心” in teal). Beneath: “明确照护重点 + 权威信息 + 及时提醒”. Third row: avatar of a male doctor/cartoon with glasses and a white coat and stethoscope; text: “医生 — 管理更高效” (with “管理更高效” in teal). Beneath: “方案制定更快 + 咨询负担更低 +\\n风险掌握更及时” (line wrapped). **Bottom band / footer strip:** A wide, emphasized banner-like area across the bottom with a rounded rectangle outline and subtle glow. On the left is a circular target/crosshair icon in teal and large text: “四项技术共同补齐院后康复四大短板” in pale yellow/white. To the right, separated by a t